>Quintas</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Almeida</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Marujo</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Pizarro</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Angelico</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name><name><surname>Fonseca</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Loureiro</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Barroso</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Machado</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Soares</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>da Costa</surname><given-names>AB</given-names></name><name><surname>de Freitas</surname><given-names>AF</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Appropriateness of emergency department visits in a Portuguese university hospital</article-title><source>Ann Emerg Med</source><year>2001</year><volume>37</volume><fpage>580</fpage><lpage>586</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11385326</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1067/mem.2001.114306</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B16"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Bianco</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Pileggi</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Angelillo</surname><given-names>IF</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Non-urgent visits to a hospital emergency department in Italy</article-title><source>Public Health</source><year>2003</year><volume>117</volume><fpage>250</fpage><lpage>255</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12966745</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0033-3506(03)00069-6</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B17"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Lang</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Davido</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><su